  <item>
    <title>吃席 EP.31：“别敲门！”，当代人如何重新学会以邻居相处？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6811ca8147ebeede7e2aba1c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6811ca8147ebeede7e2aba1c</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 30 Apr 2025 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当代人对于关系的描述是越来越精确了，从搭子到朋友，关系深浅层层递进，相处模式分工明确，边界清晰拒绝越界。但是有一种关系自古就有，如今却逐渐模糊，不知道该定义到哪一个范畴，那就是邻居关系，“肯与邻翁相对饮”的敞亮亲切早不复从前，但新型组合却也层出不穷，本期我们就此聊聊“邻里关系”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【story list】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a> 苦尽柑来遇见你，还好有些好邻居</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="293">04:53</a> 盘包浆的《请回答1988》双门洞情谊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="342">05:42</a> 上海工人新村的尿床情谊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="462">07:42</a> 浦东本地人的“村落义气”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">10:56</a> “长脚爷叔”“哭作宝”“美国人”“老人”，那些忘记本名也要记得的邻居绰号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 家长里短太亲密也会带来烦心事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 房子在变大，墙壁在变厚，邻居的关系却越来越薄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1154">19:14</a> 不远不近却需要时时维系的关系很尴尬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">20:33</a> 当代舍友，狗友，若有似无轻型无负担的新型邻里关系，识相是关键</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 疫情时候关于邻居的特殊回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1932">32:12</a> 小区微信群，炫耀修罗场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2182">36:22</a> 家门口的小店，“邻居”概念的延展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2335">38:55</a> 如果有陌生人进入你的生活，请打开窗口say hi</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63a7f562231ed12907088196/lmOYU0Pw1RCRI9ZsT0oRcdFGRUJe.m4a" length="59675857" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flc6-YkHu4uatO4WeKiYOAoIki4G.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
