    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期我们想把好好养生，当作人生救赎。</span></p><span></span><p><span>通过“身体养生”和“心理养生”，决定</span></p><span></span><p><span>“请把自己当作最重要的人。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 欢迎回来！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 中医调理之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">09:29</a>慢性病史分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>09.34老胃病患者的胃病发展史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="636">10:36</a>心绞痛解救tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 生理期解救tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="791">13:11</a> &nbsp;湿疹与免疫力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="896">14:56</a> 拒绝饮酒是救赎的开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 保健品routine</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1089">18:09</a> 理性选择保健品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 个人养生自救指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1249">20:49</a>早睡与入睡困难的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 球类运动的精神爽感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> 居家运动爽感指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1795">29:55</a> 温补运动推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1834">30:34</a>天花板是人类最大的封印</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1911">31:51</a> 懒人运动指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1992">33:12</a> 养生的“雷”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2053">34:13</a> 请把自己当作“最重要的人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2148">35:48</a> “心理养生”的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2277">37:57</a> 策略性发疯</span></p><span></span><p><span>「 自救list 」</span></p><span></span><p><span>*心绞痛：辅酶Q10（Mito Q</span></p><span></span><p><span>*湿疹：姜黄素</span></p><span></span><p><span>*生理期调理：月见草</span></p><span></span><p><span>*入睡困难：</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站《李冉在冥想》 40min 瑜伽休息术</span></p><span></span><p><span>*居家运动：</span></p><span></span><p><span>B 站《eleni fit 站立瘦腿+燃脂》30分钟</span></p>]]></description>
