  <item>
    <title>吃席 EP.23：世界“按摩”物语，体验大赏</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6641ebdc7096082641d3010f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6641ebdc7096082641d3010f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 13 May 2024 10:30:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>据说，穴位是宇宙藏在人体中的井。然后借由这口“井”为我们传递新的能量。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们想给你的“身体”放个假 。探讨一个生命不可或缺的话题 —— 按摩，聊聊世界各地那些有趣的按摩故事和体验，更轻松的为你在散步、发呆、通勤、做家务的时候，提供“一片脑海”，也祝你按摩快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>上海按摩店推荐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>「一指阁」</span></p><span></span><p><span>「春草堂」</span></p><span></span><p><span>「悠庭」</span></p><span></span><p><span>「裕和堂」</span></p><span></span><p><span>日本温泉酒店推荐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>「热海尤托雷洛酒店」</span></p><span></span><p><span>「Story List 」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="37">00:37</a> &nbsp;假期“疼痛回忆”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a> &nbsp;谁才是按摩中的“王”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="406">06:46</a> 巴厘岛按摩回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="684">11:24</a> 找到你心中的按摩之王</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1021">17:01</a> 香格里亚猎奇按摩回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1145">19:05</a> 仙女村按摩尊贵体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1351">22:31</a> 阿育吠陀按摩：一个震撼人心的按摩项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a> 按摩师的“咸猪手”与“边界感”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1656">27:36</a> 泰国监狱女子按摩体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1787">29:47</a> 当我们按摩时，我们在想什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1930">32:10</a> 世界按摩大赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 印度邪典按摩大法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2061">34:21</a> 郑州土法按摩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2142">35:42</a> 肌肉松解按摩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2224">37:04</a> 按摩小工具分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2295">38:15</a> 上海按摩店Top 3</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2395">39:55</a> 精神按摩之“午后小睡”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2619">43:39</a> 精神按摩之“桑拿回忆”</span></p>]]></description>
