  <item>
    <title>吃席 EP.22：每天都在精神裸辞的我们，还记得曾经的“理想工作”吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6625f2cb200abebe6e6af75a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6625f2cb200abebe6e6af75a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 22 Apr 2024 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大环境会让我们有时候看不到生活的彼岸，</span></p><span></span><p><span>但我们可以给自己提供一个彼岸：</span></p><span></span><p><span>我想做一名歌手；</span></p><span></span><p><span>我想成为一名科学家；</span></p><span></span><p><span>我想做太空人；</span></p><span></span><p><span>我只想做一个图书馆管理员；</span></p><span></span><p><span>这些理想和心愿，你还记得吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天想聊聊“理想工作”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>理想工作，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们想从这些曾经的“理想”中，</span></p><span></span><p><span>找到一个彼岸。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期也想聊聊为我们曾经的理想工作，关于成为一名战地记者、成为律师，也关于去换宿打工、成为“精神病院的医生”、成为一名歌手的理想…..</span></p><span></span><p><span>「换宿打工」</span></p><span></span><p><span>主要三个网站：</span></p><span></span><p><span>HelpX / WWOOF /Workaway</span></p><span></span><p><span>换宿类型：</span></p><span></span><p><span>寄宿家庭/有机农场/非有机农场/背包客栈等</span></p><span></span><p><span>工作时间：</span></p><span></span><p><span>每天约4小时/天，每周5天</span></p><span></span><p><span>（具体看host family需求）</span></p><span></span><p><span>住宿环境：</span></p><span></span><p><span>大部分是跟host family同住一个house，一起用餐；</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果是背包客栈，一般住上下铺，厨房自助。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「Story List 」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 想成为一名有正义的“战地记者”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="528">08:48</a> 成为“律师“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a> 换宿打工：想去冰岛剪羊毛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="822">13:42</a> 想当一名“精神病院的医生”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1277">21:17</a> 我的终身热爱是“歌手”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1688">28:08</a> 成为”自媒体博主”中信念感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1761">29:21</a> 我的朋友想做“殡仪馆的司仪”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1881">31:21</a> 理想工作三要素：价值观、才能和心愿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1962">32:42</a> 我们需要花更多时间了解自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1970">32:50</a> 工作是“相对理想的”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 更想成为“有班儿的人”还是“自由职业”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2474">41:14</a> 关于媒体工作的感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2585">43:05</a>工作的前提是“价值观”</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lirsIcCRdjS6TySXPjnLvaCDqS9W.m4a" length="73795833" type="audio/mp4"/>
