    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>吃席 EP.21：Dating app：左滑是放弃，右滑给亲密关系一次机会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/661379d4c891c06e73f81e7d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">661379d4c891c06e73f81e7d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Apr 2024 05:00:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>春夏交接之际，又到“想恋爱”的好季节！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们这次请来了“直男标兵”Allen，一起分享他在Dating App上的恋爱经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Dating App，可以让爱情成为“数字时代的恋爱游戏”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但我们也可以用真心、用热忱、以及 不断愿意试错的勇气，来“Find my game”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「Story List 」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 如何拓展社交性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="407">06:47</a> Dating app使用体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="756">12:36</a> “ IG文学”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">15:32</a> 一切指标皆是浪漫的敌人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1001">16:41</a> Dating app，本质是一款游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> “寻爱“热情的阈值跟年龄的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1274">21:14</a> 为“破冰”，留下一个“窗口”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1507">25:07</a> 适当展示“个人标签”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1582">26:22</a> 体验是核心，理性是装备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> 如何战术性“筛选” 可靠人选</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2168">36:08</a> 社交软件中的玩家心态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2236">37:16</a> 如何判断一段健康的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2583">43:03</a> 不管使用何种技巧，发心很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3010">50:10</a> 如何从线上到线下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3168">52:48</a> 约会地点推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3468">57:48</a> 约会中最欣赏对方的行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3700">61:40</a> 约会中的”Signal“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3948">65:48</a> 拿出不断”试错“的勇气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4050">67:30</a> “短择现象”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4117">68:37</a> “酒肉情侣现象”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4348">72:28</a> “好的恋爱关系”是怎样的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4403">73:23</a> “寻爱真谛”0基础教程是真诚</span></p>]]></description>
