  <item>
    <title>吃席 EP.20：巴厘岛与米兰，哪里会是你想象中的彼岸？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66019dac1519139e4f8a1c4f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66019dac1519139e4f8a1c4f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 25 Mar 2024 15:52:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是“有点迟到”的新年第一期，</span></p><span></span><p><span>想集中回顾一下我们各自前往了“日均精彩日落”的巴厘岛与意大利米兰，</span></p><span></span><p><span>聊聊这些的人、海、森林和身心灵。</span></p><span></span><p><span>storylist：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="24">00:24</a> 新年以来的一些旅行感想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> 与巴厘岛的神秘缘分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a> 乌鲁瓦图：Kecak舞演出精彩演出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">10:03</a> Pandawa海滩轻徒步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> 夜生活与健康生活方式兼容的土豆头酒店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 15分钟滑翔伞体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">23:15</a> 多巴胺分泌比谈恋爱都甜蜜的冲浪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1602">26:42</a> 乌布：身心灵爱好者的精神家园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a> 生命体验加倍的冥想体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2286">38:06</a> 巴厘岛名物 生物 感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2545">42:25</a> 爱家庭胜过一切的意大利人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2980">49:40</a> 火车驶近威尼斯之城</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3415">56:55</a> 去松花江做“滑雪勇士”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3912">65:12</a> 旅行感觉 忽然把打开另一个梦核世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3960">66:00</a> 松花湖滑雪惊喜Tips</span></p>]]></description>
