    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>吃席 EP.17：川崎、黄金饺与母鸡汤：想在南方中华暖锅里冬泳</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65702d07d6e0ff5822c7e820</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65702d07d6e0ff5822c7e820</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Dec 2023 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>万物有时，积极入冬。 本期我们想聊聊冬日中华饮食的南甜北咸东辣西酸。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们这些未能食素之人，冬天就想吃点儿，那就吃吧！香着呢！</span></p><span></span><p><span>上菜谱！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>南方暖锅- 黄金饺、母鸡汤、火腿与川崎</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>红焖羊肉</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>黄豆炖猪脚</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>椰子鸡</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>醉鸡煲</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>红烧狮子头</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>油面筋</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>西宁土火锅</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>牦牛肉火锅</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>热红酒</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>烤冷面</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>卤肉饭</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>红豆年糕</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>南方红烧肉</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>炸猪排与泰康牌精油</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>「 highlight 」：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>南方冬日暖锅分享</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>红焖羊肉、黄豆炖猪脚与南方人执着的红烧肉</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>室内吃火锅，寒风吃醉鸡煲</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>返璞归真的西宁土火锅与香格里拉牦牛肉火锅</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>中华东北料理之魂：烤冷面</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>辣评南方国宴大菜：红烧肉</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>去饭馆吃，别看后厨，吃得香就行</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>吃，是最好的交互环节</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>上海本帮菜餐厅一览</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>关于快手菜的问题</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
